  aciklama:
  - "Telvelerinin ilk k\u0131s\u0131mlar\u0131nda iki at ba\u015F\u0131 ve arkalar\u0131nda
    da onlara ba\u011Fl\u0131 bir \"saban\" g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Topra\u011F\u0131 alt
    \xFCst ederek \xE7ift s\xFCr\xFCld\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC g\xF6steren bu yans\u0131malar,
    kazan\xE7 i\xE7in \xE7ok u\u011Fra\u015F\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 i\u015Faret
    ediyor. Maddi sorunlar\u0131n\u0131n son zamanlarda sa\u011Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    direkt etkiledi\u011Fini hissediyorum {{isim}}. Bor\xE7 \xF6demeleri ve giderler
    sende hareket k\u0131s\u0131tl\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131 yaratt\u0131\u011F\u0131
    zamanlarda, bu stres ba\u011F\u0131\u015F\u0131kl\u0131k sistemini d\xFC\u015F\xFCr\xFCyor
    gibi g\xF6z\xFCk\xFCyor. \xD6n\xFCm\xFCzdeki {{ay_+2}} ay\u0131n\u0131n {{kelime,
    ilk | ikinci | \xFC\xE7\xFCnc\xFC}} haftas\u0131ndan itibaren bu anlamda bir
    rahatlama ya\u015Fayacaks\u0131n."
